In a motif/recoloring ARC task, reason from exact input-output changes before inferring the rule. Record changed coordinates and old/new colors, along with unchanged components. Test candidate operations against every changed and unchanged cell; a visual resemblance between an embedded shape and another cluster is not enough evidence for stamping, copying, or recoloring.

